{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他从前总想退回安宁里护住那种生活，如今带着牵挂往前，行动也在替它争取，旧愿反而近了些。\",\n      \"key\": \"旧愿近了\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"想到自己正为那种生活出力，他心里敞亮起来，惦记它也让他更有劲往前。\",\n      \"key\": \"心里敞亮\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他开始留意自己怎么做，怕一味加把劲，反而磨掉刚找回的温柔。\",\n      \"key\": \"磨掉温柔\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"那种生活还没回来，可他想起曾经的安宁仍会高兴，眼前的难处没把那份快乐抹掉。\",\n      \"key\": \"仍会高兴\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他还不知道眼前的努力能不能改变那些妨碍那种生活的事，最后又能护住多少。\",\n      \"key\": \"护住多少\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"text\": \"真到了要付出代价的时候，他还是可能累得想退回安宁。\",\n      \"key\": \"想退回安宁\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"text\": \"他把一直绷着的劲松下来，不再反复找理由证明自己该往前，仍清楚自己想护住那种生活。\",\n      \"key\": \"松下来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R65\", \"R66\", \"R67\", \"R68\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他曾想退回安宁护住旧愿、如今发现行动也在替它争取的反转。R67与R68重复的不愿旁观不再单列，行动理由由前段经历和跨段箭头承接。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R70\", \"R71\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把两种心意共同推动他的抽象结论，改成想到自己正在为旧愿出力时的敞亮和劲头，也保留惦记不再成为行动的负担。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\", \"R76\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\", \"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把抽象的坚持原则和价值判断落实为两件实际顾虑：行动方式可能磨损温柔，努力也未必能改变妨碍旧愿的事。保留他开始留意付出代价的变化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R72\", \"R75\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留旧日安宁带来的快乐重新可感，心愿未成也没有抹掉已经得到的东西。删去整齐对照式的态度总结。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R73\", \"R77\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\", \"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把生活尚未回来放进旧日快乐仍真实的事实里，把努力能否改变现实、最终能护住多少放进具体的未知，避免重复概括结果没有保证。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R74\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留未来真正要付出代价时仍可能疲惫、想退回安宁的风险，删去两种渴望仍有冲突的哲理性补充。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R78\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-7\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他不再反复证明自己该向前的变化，同时让紧绷的劲松下来、想护住的生活仍然清楚，具体解释结尾的收束。删去与R75重复的忘掉任何一边。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6b6d2fed-ee00-4373-a887-021078d08ec3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T011301275352Z", "elapsed_seconds": 202.844, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T01:16:24.146300+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "435b8f6366199d69e12182ac13669e5b2aa8a1c644d3daf738c6177c2c83f4c5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T011301275352Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "d612b4ab4737f0b6463a3215ba229117396d4ca87ffc0416f661d9cb205ffec8"}}}
